  "bio": "Infuse your skin with art at 2 Extreme Tattoos, the Clearwater haven for fans of hyper-realistic ink. Nestled in the bustling heart of various Florida malls, including University Mall in Tampa and Countryside Mall in Clearwater, our studio specializes in transforming your visions into breathtakingly lifelike tattoos. Step into our creative sanctum at Krates at the Grove in Wesley Chapel and watch as our adept artists make permanence beautiful.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Clearwater, Florida, United States"
